===Etymology 3===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*peth₂-}}
[[Image:Ballpoint-pen-parts.jpg|thumb|right|A [[ballpoint pen]], showing assembly.]]
From {{inh|en|enm|penne}}, from {{der|en|xno|penne}}, from {{der|en|fro|penne}}, from {{der|en|la|penna|t=feather}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*péth₂r̥|*péth₂r̥ ~ pth₂én-|t=feather, wing}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*peth₂-|t=to rush, fly}} (from which {{m|en|petition}}). Proto-Indo-European base also root of {{m|ine-pro|*petra-}}, from which {{cog|grc|πτερόν|t=wing}} (whence {{m|en|pterodactyl}}), {{cog|sa|पत्रम्|t=wing, feather}}, {{cog|cu|перо|t=pen}}, {{cog|non|fjǫðr}}, {{cog|ang|feðer}} (Modern English {{m|en|feather}});<ref name="oetyld"/> note the /p/ → /f/ Germanic sound change.

{{doublet|en|panne|penna|pinna}}. See {{m|en|feather}} and {{m|grc|πέτομαι}} for more.

====Noun====
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# A tool, originally made from a [[feather]] but now usually a small tubular instrument, containing ink used to [[write]] or make marks.
#: {{ux|en|He took notes with a '''pen'''.}}
# {{lb|en|figurative}} A writer, or their style.
#: {{ux|en|He has a sharp '''pen'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Fuller Church History|passage=those learned '''pens'''}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} Marks of ink left by a pen.
#: {{ux|en|He's unhappy because he got '''pen''' on his new shirt.}}
# A [[light pen]].
# {{lb|en|zoology}} The internal [[cartilage]] skeleton of a [[squid]], shaped like a pen.
#* {{quote-book|en|author=Danna Staaf|title=Squid Empire|publisher=ForeEdge|year=2017|isbn=9781611689235|page=117|passage=A '''pen''' is nothing more complex than a decalcified shell, so one mutation of the genes that controlled calcification could be all it took.}}
# {{lb|en|now|rare|poetic|dialectal}} A [[feather]], especially one of the flight feathers of a bird, angel etc.
#* {{RQ:Spenser Faerie Queene|passage=And eke the '''pennes''', that did his pineons bynd, <br> Were like mayne-yards, with flying canuas lynd, <br> With which whenas him liſt the ayre to beat {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|poetic}} A [[wing]].
#* {{RQ:Milton Paradise Lost|passage=but feather'd soon and fledge <br>They summed their '''pens''', and soaring the air sublime}}

